Notes on provenance

The private tag data in this repository was compiled by automated extraction
from vendor DICOM conformance statements. Those documents remain the property
of their respective vendors (GE HealthCare, Siemens Healthineers, Philips
Healthcare, and others). The compiled tag records (names, VR codes, element
numbers) represent factual technical information that has been extracted,
structured, and curated; they do not reproduce substantial portions of the
source documents.

The DICOM standard data (data/standard/) is derived from DICOM PS3.6 as
published by the National Electrical Manufacturers Association (NEMA) under
their open publication policy.
